  "about": "Labelled queries for the skill search. Relevance is decided by cue patterns written from domain knowledge BEFORE looking at any ranking, and applied to the whole skill list (18,161 texts), so recall can be counted. grade 2 = relevant (matches `relevant`), grade 1 = related (matches `related` only), grade 0 = everything else. Malay and cross-language queries use English cue patterns, so a keyword-only system cannot pass them by matching the query word. Written by Claude, NOT reviewed by a teammate. 'dev' queries were used while building; 'test' queries were not looked at until the final run. Small set: use it to compare versions, not as proof of general accuracy. 'test2' queries were added after the first full run, before the BM25 coverage rule was tried, to check that rule on queries not looked at before.",
